sub Reset linking information
efs: Testing.InitializeLinkings( [BTM.Linking.LinkingDataStruct { Orientation => OrientationEnum.Nominal, BaliseGroupIdentifier => 5461, CountryIdentifier => 85, Distance => 250.0, LocationAccuracy => 0.7, Reaction => BTM.Linking.LinkingReaction.CommandServiceBrake }] )
step Receive a infill MA from a balise
sub First balise
telegram balise Q_UPDOWN=0 M_VERSION=17 Q_MEDIA=0 N_PIG=0 N_TOTAL=1 M_DUP=0 M_MCOUNT=255 NID_C=85 NID_BG=5460 Q_LINK=0
sub Second balise - infill MA with only 1 section
telegram balise Q_UPDOWN=0 M_VERSION=17 Q_MEDIA=0 N_PIG=1 N_TOTAL=1 M_DUP=0 M_MCOUNT=255 NID_C=85 NID_BG=5460 Q_LINK=0 | INFILL_LOCATION_REFERENCE NID_PACKET=136 Q_DIR=1 L_PACKET=0 Q_NEWCOUNTRY=0 NID_C=85 NID_BG=5461 | LEVEL_1_MOVEMENT_AUTHORITY NID_PACKET=12 Q_DIR=1 L_PACKET=0 Q_SCALE=1 V_MAIN=60 V_EMA=8 T_EMA=180 N_ITER=0 L_ENDSECTION=2000 Q_SECTIONTIMER=0 Q_ENDTIMER=0 Q_DANGERPOINT=0 Q_OVERLAP=0 T_SECTIONTIMER=0 D_SECTIONTIMERSTOPLOC=0 T_ENDTIMER=0 D_ENDTIMERSTARTLOC=0 D_DP=0 V_RELEASEDP=0 D_STARTOL=0 T_OL=0 D_OL=0 V_RELEASEOL=0
sub new MA section at the location of the main signal
expect efs: THERE_IS X IN BTM.Linking.Linkings | X.Distance == (FIRST X IN Kernel.MA.MA.Sections).Length @ deadline=1
expect efs: (COUNT X IN Kernel.MA.MA.Sections) == 2 @ deadline=1
expect efs: (FIRST X IN Kernel.MA.MA.Sections).Length == 250.0 @ deadline=1
sequence MA from RBC
case MA received from an RBC and by BTM.Message
clause - absent 3.8.3.9 ; efs 3.8.3.9
clause - absent 3.8.3.6 ; efs 3.8.3.6
